"- Learn how to implement accurate dynamic decoupling by using [stretch](/guides/stretch).\n"
"- Review the [classical feedforward and control flow](/guides/classical-feedforward-and-control-flow) guide.\n"
"- Use [circuit schedule visualization](/guides/qiskit-runtime-circuit-timing) to debug and optimize your dynamic circuits.\n"
"- Not all functions are compatible with dynamic circuits. Check the feature compatibility section for [Sampler](/guides/sampler-options#feature-compatibility) for details.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Mga rekomendasyon\">\n"
"- Matuto kung paano ipatupad ang tumpak na dynamic decoupling sa pamamagitan ng paggamit ng [stretch](/guides/stretch).\n"
"- Suriin ang gabay na [classical feedforward at control flow](/guides/classical-feedforward-and-control-flow).\n"
"- Gamitin ang [visualization ng circuit schedule](/guides/qiskit-runtime-circuit-timing) para mag-debug at mag-optimize ng iyong mga dynamic na circuit.\n"
"- Hindi lahat ng function ay compatible sa mga dynamic na circuit. Tingnan ang seksyon ng feature compatibility para sa [Sampler](/guides/sampler-options#feature-compatibility) o [Executor](/guides/executor-options#feature-compatibility) para sa mga detalye.\n"
